<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak H1 1996 real GDP rises 7.1 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Slovak H1 1996 real GDP rises 7.1 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real gross domestic product in Slovakia in the first six months of the year rose 7.1 percent, the Slovak Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>SUSR also said forecasted 7.0 percent year-on-year growth of the real GDP for the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>    SLOVAK REAL GDP	 H1 1996   H1 1995  FY 1995</p>
<p>    pct chg yr/yr	    +7.1	 n/a     +7.4</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
